---
import Announcement from "./Announcement.astro";
---

<section id="home-announcements" class="container mb-4">
  <div
    class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-lg-3 g-4 mx-1 justify-content-center"
  >
  <Announcement
      title="Interested in Joining FAMNM?"
      image="index/announcements/general_fall_2019.jpg"
      alt="FAMNM members conduct a meeting in a classroom"
      links={[
        {
          text: "Interest Form",
          link: "https://forms.gle/tuHsm3udnLim2a296"
        },
      ]}
    >
       <!-- Come to our Fall 2025 General Body Meetings <b
        >every Monday at 8 PM in FXB</b
      >, and fill out the interest form linked below to get added to our Slack
      workspace and Google Drive. -->

      Come to our Fall 2026 interest meeting on Wednesday,
      September 7th from 7:00pm to 8:00pm at the EECS Building,
      room 1003. If you can not make the meeting, please fill out the interest form below,
      and look out for updates.
    </Announcement>
    <Announcement
      title="Workshops"
      image="teams/fr_mentor2.jpg"
      alt="Freelance mentors from FAMNM helping out an FRC team"
      links={[
        {
          text: "Learn more!",
          link: "https://www.famnm.club/teams/workshops/",
        },
      ]}
    >
      Come to our workshops throughout the year to learn about robotics! 
      They are hosted on University of Michigan's campus. Stay tuned for a updated schedule.
    </Announcement>
    <Announcement
      title="Wolverine Robotics Competition"
      image="offseason/wolverine_robotics_competiton_logo_cropped.png"
      alt="WRC logo"
      links={[
        {
          text: "Learn more!",
          link: "https://www.famnm.club/offseason",
        },
      ]}
    >
      The Wolverine Robotics Competition was an offseason FRC event
      that took place on <b>August 1st, 2026</b> at Skyline High School! 
    </Announcement>
  </div>
</section>
